  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The latest update added a debug UI that shows the network ID of a given object, but we cannot use this on Quest. \nNetwork sync can break between PC and Quest and it's often hard to figure out why - if we had at least access to the network ID of a given object in Udon, we could \"debug\" this on the quest with our own in-world UI.\nThis would also make debugging easier in general since not every test user knows how to activate the debug UI or can use it in VR. I usually rely on information from random VR users in VRChat to help me with testing something, using my own in-world debug UI, since they obviously don't have UI debug options enabled.",
